le="x-bg" begin="1:12.562" end="1:13.375"><span begin="1:12.562" end="1:13.066">(love</span> <span begin="1:13.066" end="1:13.375">me)</span></span></p><p begin="1:13.478" end="1:16.698" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.478" end="1:14.158">You</span> <span begin="1:14.158" end="1:14.718">can,</span> <span begin="1:14.718" end="1:14.918">you</span> <span begin="1:14.918" end="1:15.238">can</span> <span begin="1:15.238" end="1:15.488">live</span> <span begin="1:15.488" end="1:15.678">with</span><span begin="1:15.678" end="1:16.278">out</span> <span begin="1:16.278" end="1:16.698">me</span></p><p begin="1:16.738" end="1:18.588" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.738" end="1:16.998">That</span> <span begin="1:16.998" end="1:17.308">makes</span> <span begin="1:17.308" end="1:17.558">me</span> <span begin="1:17.558" end="1:17.768">un</span><span begin="1:17.768" end="1:18.228">hap</span><span begin="1:18.228" end="1:18.588">py</span></p><p begin="1:18.815" end="1:22.105" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.815" end="1:19.005">I</span> <span begin="1:19.005" end="1:19.285">should</span> <span begin="1:19.285" end="1:19.595">get</span> <span begin="1:19.595" end="1:19.755">a</span> <span begin="1:19.755" end="1:20.275">pierc</span><span begin="1:20.275" end="1:20.835">ing</span> <span begin="1:20.835" end="1:21.325">through</span> <span begin="1:21.325" end="1:21.585">my</span> <span begin="1:21.585" end="1:22.105">heart</span></p></div></body></tt>